[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507838253","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112558#issuecomment-3507838253","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112558","id":3507838253,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RFV0t","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T09:37:38Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T09:37:38Z","body":"It needs tweaks to individual elements at this point as I hinted in my [comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112350#issuecomment-3482872437) because while some elements gained visibility as a result of 2 global contrast bumps after the theme was ported from gdscript, some elements lost it.\r\n\r\nFor example pressed buttons need _less_ luminance now because their icons are starting to get lost in the background:\r\n\r\n![s](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce97af76-c940-4670-a968-8a5d0e22de93)\r\n\r\nI think it will be better to do fine color adjustments closer to release in one sweep after most of the issues are addressed and the theme is more stable, as the colors of some elements aren't final yet, i.e popup menus may need to change significantly after they [get their shadows](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112230#issuecomment-3477391435), nested tabs still need work, inspector sections need work, etc.\r\n\r\nWhen we do those final color tweaks I also want to look into making text a bit brighter and [repeating icons less distracting](https://bsky.app/profile/fvsch.com/post/3lsnotc5wrk2u).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507838253/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508114442","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112558#issuecomment-3508114442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112558","id":3508114442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RGZQK","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"pu