//api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-10T15:58:41Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T15:58:41Z","body":"Decided to adjust the text/icon contrast too. Screenshots updated\r\n\r\n@passivestar would you take another look?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3512572498/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3516086249","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112558#issuecomment-3516086249","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112558","id":3516086249,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Rkzfp","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-11T10:19:27Z","updated_at":"2025-11-11T10:46:53Z","body":"> @passivestar would you take another look?\r\n\r\nThe overall contrast change is good. Some feedback:\r\n\r\n1. Font became too contrasty, `0.75` looks better imo.\r\n2. You dropped button hover luminance which makes its border much more visible on hover than in its regular state, maybe button hover should be a bit brighter still\r\n3. If we're doing all contrast tweaks in this PR could you make the hover indication in `PopupMenu` much more subtle? It's currently more contrasty than all other hovers in the editor\r\n4. Tree header cells are also too dark at the moment against some backgrounds, could be made a bit brighter. Unfortunately we can't make them semi-transparent to work on different backgrounds because tree content goes under them\r\n5. Another thing I noticed is that text in `Checkbox`es looks pure white (i.e look at Debugger -> Visual Profiler -> Fit To Frame), it's probably missing a color assignment or smth\r\n6. Since you made the pressed buttons more subtle maybe this PR should close https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112385\r\n\r\nThis is an improvement but as I mentioned in my previous message it's unlikely that all of these values will be final because further balancing tweaks will be needed closer to release. Later it will also probably make sense to bring the editor setting contrast back to its original `0.3` value while keeping all visual changes by doing them in theme code, just to have a less arbitrary value in settings","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3516086249/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3524488169","html_url":"htt